  "hardware": "ACME  Combustion Integrated Rack (CIR) https://www1.grc.nasa.gov/space/iss-research/iss-fcf/combustion-science/acme/implementation/  https://www1.grc.nasa.gov/space/iss-research/iss-fcf/cir/",
